Subject: [PATCH v5 4/6] phy: exynos5-usbdrd: support HS combo phy for
 ExynosAutov920
Date: Tue,  5 Aug 2025 17:22:14 +0530
Message-Id: <20250805115216.3798121-5-pritam.sutar@samsung.com>
